Form (shape) is done. Next up is the big one: upgrading the AI into a proper conversational assistant.

Server-side changes (server.js):
1. Add synonym expansion to the legal search.
2. Add score to the lawsAnswer result.
3. Add KB (portal + RP terms), intents (small talk, math, time, jokes, self-intro, capabilities), context carry-over, and fallback.
4. POST /api/ai accepts history and calls aiReply.

Client-side changes (app.js): send history along with the question.

Alright, let me write the server edits. First, modify lawsAnswer: expand tokens and return score.

Current relevant code (after previous edits):
```
  const qTokens = tokenize(q);
  if (!qTokens.length) {
    return { text: 'Сформулируйте вопрос...', sources: [] };
  }
  const scored = [];
  const qStems = qTokens.map(stem);
  ...
  const top = scored.slice(0, 3).filter(x => x.score >= 6);
  if (!top.length) {
    return { text: 'Точной статьи ...', sources: ... };
  }
  ...
  return {
    text: 'По вашему вопросу нашлось...',
    sources
  };
```

